{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1000_002chi", "source_sha256": "b074022b748c8cfa7c6b436dc43e33c36265f3eb52f28e8d68161a8786b39912", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\n今日は事務所ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，工作辛苦了。\n你今天是在事务所做事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ad4a050cfa28698d606d63ab63428ef46a49d2504b5625ce32bfc9a7297d1b64", "ja": "ああ、千早、お疲れ様。社長に呼ばれて来たんだけど、\nじつは千早にも話があるんだ。", "zh": "啊，千早，你辛苦了。\n是社长叫我来的，但我也有事要找你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "be5f60db417f78fd62d82244893e929feee0c8cc57be280c175c7342109acea5", "ja": "えっ、私に？　なんでしょう？", "zh": "咦，找我吗？什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a8be9427c92705f3b0657805f6eb8adaa0a56901e5c11bacbbd51e48e3b51a0b", "ja": "この間、歌番組に出てもらっただろ？\nあの時の歌の評判が、すごく良いらしくて。", "zh": "你前阵子不是有上歌唱节目吗？\n你那时唱的歌，好像大受好评。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "136a7f54e8d2c9386efe8c9c0d90f6e7536b66546a5d441421dcde5c7cf45966", "ja": "あ……よかったです。最善は尽くしたつもりですが、\nTVを通して心に届けるのは、やはり難しいですから。", "zh": "啊……那太好了。毕竟我虽然尽了全力，\n但要透过电视来传达心意，还是很大的考验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "97195c9b614edd32054fec092cd02192ac3edfc7b6136ae363d7f1bf1b3bf350", "ja": "で、さっそく先方から\n次回の出演オファーが届いたんだ。いいかな？", "zh": "然后啊，客户马上又发了下次录影的工作邀约。\n你愿意接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "f9cd481dfd41fbc764f611f85eff0ca0efc29dd6eeb0ff0b62692d96c86835dd", "ja": "もちろんです。\n歌う機会をいただけるのなら、私は喜んで……", "zh": "那当然。\n如果能获得唱歌的机会，我很乐意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "e40c2d9ff9cd31be6cac712dd2941ac7a1c7e056b219b552cb3a4dbf9ed6b5e3", "ja": "はっ！　ちょっと待って下さい！", "zh": "啊！先等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5f2315e0f5e3217d95eb17e2ab30d52b230c67e92b4a50665620305474efc58b", "ja": "うわっ。急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "哇，怎么突然大叫？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "b42050abe32aec0c509b0e9a2aa0518a5b5465c2943d73b0873b4dfc6f46b166", "ja": "確か、あの番組で歌う前に……\nとても恥ずかしい格好をさせられたはず……！", "zh": "我记得我在那个节目唱歌前……\n被要求打扮成让人很难为情的造型……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a7657bc2104f7730a1d2fe228ea685e0974738267af519b1dad4b8a3f7060edc", "ja": "とても恥ずかしい格好……？", "zh": "很难为情的造型……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "09d497edd4cac0413eea1e6543afba943cb98035a5674581648d67af8b930a4a", "ja": "あっ。もしかして、出演前のグラビア撮影で\n着てもらった、白スクール水着＆白猫衣装のことか？", "zh": "啊，该不会是录影前在拍写真照时，\n请你穿上的白色学校泳装和白猫服装吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "c2db70ed85378fc6202226a82174448458072a2f5c993001d1bb51a4af71952a", "ja": "もしかしなくても、その格好です！\n口に出して言わないでください……！", "zh": "不用问，我就是在讲那副打扮！\n拜托你别把它说出来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "48f6b9ed072d2794a33d24801613ef1ae6ba443b727cd29371fc80e6a618aafb", "ja": "うーん、そうは言うけど。じつはあのグラビアも、\n千早の歌と同じくらい評判がよくて。", "zh": "唔～话是这么说没错啦。\n但是那组写真照，也跟千早的演唱一样大受好评喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "7a972174ca8786daeffb46428244145b53c3c7a4f3175ed50a9540252d5e0647", "ja": "えっ。……ええっ！？", "zh": "咦……什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a1786047684a6236f1d5f1dc7353e10729c51887ba9e738b93e92b80db47aee0", "ja": "SNSでも話題になってたし、あの姿の千早を見て\nファンになったって書き込みも、かなり見かけたし。", "zh": "而且在SNS上也引爆话题，还见到不少人发文说，\n看到那副打扮的千早后就成为粉丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "af63b966c019c03471bf544d296bc5dd0e6ec4295a6d015e200c3c38a2a2b0d7", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。歌を聞いてもらえるキッカケに\nなった……と、いうことでしょうか……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……写真照成了听我唱歌的起因……\n是、是这个意思吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5e10f2158e5fe2520c27b6d3a41460f3f398c09f3276abbcb3ec8c0253b9af0e", "ja": "そういうこと。千早の可能性も広がるし、表現の勉強に\n……ならなくもないし、たまにはいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "没错，而且既能扩展千早的可能性，\n对于增进表现力嘛……也算有帮助。偶尔试试也不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "5c27d2fb9bc4799693dc38d1f969f95221f6fd7b17e5f2bceecd378866e31262", "ja": "わ、わかりました。たまに……\nごくたまに、ものすごく稀に、でしたら……。", "zh": "我、我知道了。如果只是偶尔……\n非常偶尔，几乎微乎其微的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1019_p", "source_sha256": "61180b14c8fe8a7b20407ebde9e29a46716d7046c80a8117666e2de234fa0f7b", "ja": "どんどん頻度が下がってるような……まあいい。\nとにかく、番組は歌うだけのはずだから安心してくれ。", "zh": "频率好像越来越下降了……算了没关系。\n总之，在节目上应该只要唱歌就好，你可以放心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "65c6e1ff2339cb94754db25dcec0ef86809c65df23e25a2b16a7feb691615cdd", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかった……！\nでしたら大丈夫です。やります、やらせてください！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了……！\n那就没问题了。我愿意接，请让我接这个通告吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3c04df654a35a101c6610b66f9d1c4d690d0f9381ca7f0cd84e02859fd9af0ed", "ja": "あ、ああ、それはよかった。そうそう、さっき\n番組の企画書も届いたんだ。一応見ておこうか。", "zh": "嗯，好啊，那太好了。对了对了，\n刚才节目的企划书也送来了，你先大致看一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "e9024abd38bc5723b070a4891351e15e9de34c4a0869348afa2a095c42924b69", "ja": "はい、ぜひ……あっ。", "zh": "好的，请务必让我看看……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1023_se", "source_sha256": "eeaa20874893f4262aaf26426c7f851f36302b61d543c27001ee61de72aed510", "ja": "（パラリ）", "zh": "（飘落在地）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1024_p", "source_sha256": "74a32ea2e83fe92c6f0d17ce19319ea0c1733e0ff4eaff76c009f83b52af97dc", "ja": "ん？　メモが挟まってたみたいだな。\nえ～っと、「次回から番組リニューアル！」？", "zh": "嗯？好像夹着便条纸呢。\n我看看～「从下集开始节目将会推陈出新！」？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3a4fd6124d4bf2aea2570f4cecb7a5f71636000d52580e4fdaa55eff03311dc7", "ja": "「歌うアイドル大集合、キラキラどうぶつ園～！\n第一回は、白ウサギちゃん選手権でーす！」", "zh": "「歌唱偶像大集合，闪亮亮动物园～！\n第一集是小白兔大赛～！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1027_p", "source_sha256": "53c39aa5d13225b9e0742e78a1f447394070a3cff2cab5e7da3f77ffe7e5d4b5", "ja": "……なるほど。", "zh": "……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "d307f1cc833f24efe46257345fc9aeb7f378ab7251a7b2ce603ec23ed01bae67", "ja": "なるほどじゃありませんっ！\nやはり、このお話は……なかったことに！", "zh": "别说什么原来如此！\n果然这份工作……还是当作没提过吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0053_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b6fad5f76e77de7467f79f546b29e8de064519eea61a6f10ac95e99dccbbecc4", "ja": "あっ、待ってくれ千早！　確かにウサギだけど、\nそんな脱兎のごとく逃げなくても……千早ー！", "zh": "啊，等等啊千早！虽然的确是要扮兔子，\n但你也不用逃得像兔子那样飞快吧……千早～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
